{"id": "section-body-13627", "title": "Skin Lightening Effects", "chapterId": "chapter-thirteen", "blocks": [{"id": "body-13627", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading2", "text": "Skin Lightening Effects", "runs": [{"text": "Skin"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Lightening"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Effects"}], "level": 2, "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "1368"}}, {"id": "body-13628", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Skin lightening (SL) is a practice where a person intentionally reduces the natural melanin pigmentation of their skin. The use of cosmetic, non-medical skin depigmentation is common among darker-skinned individuals globally.", "runs": [{"text": "Skin lightening (SL) is a practice where a person intentionally reduces the natural melanin pigmentation of their skin. The use of cosmetic, non-medical skin depigmentation is common among darker-skinned individuals globally."}]}, {"id": "body-13629", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Skin-lightening (or \"skin-bleaching\") agents are vital tools in managing disorders of hyperpigmentation such as melasma and post-inflammatory hyperpigmentation. However, some skin-lightening practices and ingredients can lead to various short- and long-term complications.", "runs": [{"text": "Skin-lightening (or \"skin-bleaching\") agents are vital tools in managing disorders of hyperpigmentation such as melasma and post-inflammatory"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "hyperpigmentation."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "However,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "some"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "skin-lightening"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "practices"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "ingredients"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "can"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "lead"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "various"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "short-"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and long-term complications."}]}, {"id": "body-13631", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Sk